{"id":"a1a03b710eb5e4df","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Pseudo Power Bound","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound — ZFC Pcf3 Pseudo Power Bound","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound — ZFC Pcf3 Pseudo Power Bound","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-pseudo-power]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound — ZFC Pcf3 Pseudo Power Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c21bafd4e0cb5f89\" href=\"?note=c21bafd4e0cb5f89\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-pseudo-power\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-pseudo-power</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu,\\lambda,\\theta\\in V\">\\(\\mu,\\lambda,\\theta\\in V\\)</span> (singular cardinal, cardinal bound, and pseudo-power witness).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PseudoPower}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PseudoPower}_S\\)</span> (canonical pseudo-power predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PseudoPowerBound}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PseudoPowerBound}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}pseudo\\text{-}power\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PseudoPowerBound}_S(\\mu,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\exists\\theta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PseudoPower}_S(\\mu,\\theta)\\land\\theta\\leq\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}pseudo\\text{-}power\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PseudoPowerBound}_S(\\mu,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\exists\\theta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PseudoPower}_S(\\mu,\\theta)\\land\\theta\\leq\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This predicate states that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> bounds the canonical pseudo-power value; the pcf supremum is defined only once upstream.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-pseudo-power","status":"resolved","id":"c21bafd4e0cb5f89","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-pseudo-power]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu,\\lambda,\\theta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PseudoPower}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PseudoPowerBound}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}pseudo\\text{-}power\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PseudoPowerBound}_S(\\mu,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\exists\\theta\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PseudoPower}_S(\\mu,\\theta)\\land\\theta\\leq\\lambda)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1075,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3072","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound.md|58-df-zfc-pcf3-pseudo-power-bound]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["c21bafd4e0cb5f89","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}